# 🚀 **Iridium 1.0.0 - Initial Release** 

*Released: 2026-01-09*

## ✨ New Features

* 🎨 **Complete UI Redesign**: Modern dark theme with glassmorphism effects
* 🏷️ **Connection Labels**: Customize IPv4/IPv6 connection names (no more hardcoded labels)
* ✏️ **Edit Nodes**: Edit external nodes after adding (name, IP, port, SNI, OBFS, etc.)
* 🌈 **New Branding**: Renamed from Blitz to IridiumGo

## 🎯 UI/UX Improvements

* New animated login page with particle effects
* Modern dashboard with gradient stat cards
* Improved dark mode with better contrast
* Updated navigation and sidebar design
* Bootstrap 5 migration for better responsiveness

## 🔧 Technical Changes

* Added `/api/v1/config/ip/labels` endpoints for connection label management
* Added `/api/v1/config/ip/nodes/edit` endpoint for node editing
* Extended `node.py` CLI with `edit` command
* Updated all GitHub references to fork repository

## 📦 Based On

Forked from [Blitz Panel](https://github.com/ReturnFI/Blitz) v2.5.1
